# Written for this pack by BurN-30 (GPL-3.0). From the Maraudon steps of 22-feralas.guide (sources:
# Polestar's Forever data and Dungeons codex, data-v2026.11.1; prerequisites: none but 7046 after
# 7044, Polestar and the TrinityCore base agree; inside, the orange side, the purple side, then the
# inner part: Warcraft Tavern's Forever Maraudon quest guide read on 12/11/2026, itself from
# Classic). Not played in game yet: places inside are to check in game.
#
# Self-contained chapter for Polestar's own route. Polestar's route passes Desolace at 38-39, below
# the dungeon's quests, and leaves it out (data/dungeon-runs.json "notInRoute"); at 45 its
# Shen'dralas guide (forever/40-50/shendralas) ends a short ride south of Maraudon's door, before
# the ride into Feralas. The Groupe Alliance module offers this chapter once Historian Biraxas's
# A Heart of Crystal (99257) or Mithera's quest (93362) is handed in, at the end of Shen'dralas,
# and opens it in a tab of its own: Woodwyrd in the Forlorn Gardens first, north into Desolace for
# Willow and Nijel's Point, the run, then Woodwyrd again and the hand-ins at Kormek's Hut and
# Nijel's Point; the flight from Nijel's Point to Feathermoon Stronghold joins the route's Feralas
# guide where it starts.
#
# Compared with Polestar 0.4.2.2's own Maraudon page (Dungeons codex, Polestar_Codex, GPL-3.0, page
# "maraudon"):
# - its levels for Forever: group finder 46 to 55, entry about 48 (this pack said 42 to 51, the
#   original game's): at 45-46 the run takes a solid group of 5;
# - Twisted Evils asks 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings on Forever (Polestar's data and forever-db), not
#   15 as this pack said;
# - Rot and Regret (93404, Woodwyrd in Shen'dralas' Forlorn Gardens, Forever only): on its page and
#   not in this pack before; its Vial of Earth Song Water comes from an object inside Maraudon
#   (Polestar's data/mechanics-public.json, players' recordings to 20/11/2026: 46 looted it), and
#   its prerequisite (93594) is done by the Shen'dralas guide: taken and handed in here;
# - Shadowshard Fragments (7070, Archmage Tervosh, Theramore) and The Pariah's Instructions (7067,
#   five centaur khans across Desolace): on its page, left out (the giver is off this chapter's way,
#   the khans too);
# - same otherwise: Vyletongue Corruption (7041), Corruption of Earth and Seed (7065), Twisted Evils
#   (7028), Legends of Maraudon and The Scepter of Celebras (7044, 7046), Seed of Life (7066).
guide groupe-alliance/maraudon
title Dungeon · Maraudon (46-51)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 46-51
zone Desolace

step Shen'dralas: Woodwyrd
  zone Shen'dralas
  tip Maraudon: the caves of the centaurs' sacred ground in western Desolace, for a group of 5, levels 46 to 55 in the group finder: at 46 it takes a solid group, from about 48 it goes well. A long dungeon: two wings, then the inner part, whose last boss is 51. Woodwyrd, the treant in the middle of the Forlorn Gardens, wants water from inside it.
  note Keep 7 free quest log slots. The way: north into Desolace for Willow and Nijel's Point, back south-west to the caves, the run, then Woodwyrd and the hand-ins; the flight from Nijel's Point to Feathermoon Stronghold joins the route's Feralas guide.
  accept 93404 "Rot and Regret" @69.5,71.9                     -- Woodwyrd: Rot and Regret

step Desolace: Willow
  zone Desolace
  tip Ride north out of Shen'dralas through the Valley of Bones and on along the road to Kormek's Hut, by Thunder Axe Fortress: Willow waits there.
  accept 7028                         -- Willow

step Nijel's Point
  zone Desolace
  tip North up the road to the night elf outpost. Talendria's quest cannot be shared: each player takes it here, with its Coated Cerulean Vial. Corruption of Earth and Seed needs level 45.
  accept 7041                         -- Talendria
  accept 7065                         -- Keeper Marandis

step Maraudon: before going in
  zone Desolace
  tip Ride south-west to the Valley of Spears: the caves of Maraudon open in the hills west of it. Cavindra waits in the first cave. Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at an orange crystal pool, outside the orange portal (the right-hand path where the caves split); the blue water does not count.
  note In the quest log before going in: Rot and Regret (Woodwyrd), Twisted Evils (Willow), Vyletongue Corruption and Corruption of Earth and Seed (Nijel's Point), Legends of Maraudon (Cavindra, here). Share each one but Talendria's with the group: click it in the quest log, then Share.
  accept 7044                         -- Cavindra
  collect 17696 quest 7041 @33.2,65.7 -- Filled Cerulean Vial: the orange crystal pool
  goto 29.1,62.5 "Maraudon" r 25

step Maraudon: along the way
  along until mara-end
  collect 17684 x25 quest 7028

step Maraudon: the orange side
  tip On the orange side, by the Vylestem Vines: use the Filled Cerulean Vial near one, a Noxxious Scion comes out (45, immune to Nature); kill it to heal the vine, 8 times. Noxxion, at the end of this side, drops the Celebrian Rod.
  note Collected all through the dungeon: the Theradric Crystal Carvings, from the centaurs, satyrs and dryads and from most bosses. Every player with the quest loots their own.
  kill 13696 x8 quest 7041            -- Noxxious Scion: one per vine
  collect 17702 quest 7044            -- Celebrian Rod: Noxxion

step Maraudon: the purple side
  tip Back out and in through the purple portal: Lord Vyletongue, at the end of this side, drops the Celebrian Diamond.
  collect 17703 quest 7044            -- Celebrian Diamond: Lord Vyletongue

step Maraudon: Celebras
  tip In the inner part, Celebras the Cursed: once beaten, he comes back as Celebras the Redeemed. Hand him Legends of Maraudon; his next quest cannot be shared: each player takes it, then waits while he makes the scepter and speaks with him again.
  turnin 7044                         -- Celebras the Redeemed
  accept 7046
  complete 7046
  turnin 7046

step Maraudon: the Earth Song Falls
  tip The inner part's great cavern, under the falls: the Vial of Earth Song Water for Woodwyrd is an object there, which every player with the quest takes. Its exact place is to check in game.
  collect 258296 quest 93404          -- Vial of Earth Song Water

step Maraudon: Princess Theradras
  label mara-end
  tip Princess Theradras, the last boss (51), at the far end of the inner part. Zaetar's Spirit then rises: its quest, Seed of Life, goes to Keeper Remulos in Moonglade; keep it until the route passes there, around 53 on the way to Winterspring.
  kill 12201                          -- Princess Theradras
  kill 12201 quest 7065               -- Princess Theradras, for Corruption of Earth and Seed
  accept 7066 optional                -- Zaetar's Spirit

step Shen'dralas: Woodwyrd
  when onquest 93404
  zone Shen'dralas
  tip Out of the caves, south through the Valley of Bones to the Forlorn Gardens: pour the water on Woodwyrd, then hand it in. No Vial of Earth Song Water? Skip this step: Rot and Regret waits for another run.
  complete 93404 "Rot and Regret" @69.0,70.6           -- Woodwyrd extinguished
  turnin 93404 "Rot and Regret"                        -- Woodwyrd

step Maraudon: quests not done
  when onquest 7065
  when !complete 7065
  tip Princess Theradras not beaten: Corruption of Earth and Seed cannot be finished on this route, which does not come back to Desolace. Abandon it.
  abandon 7065

step Desolace: Willow
  zone Desolace
  tip North again along the road: Willow at Kormek's Hut.
  turnin 7028                         -- Willow

step Nijel's Point: the rewards
  zone Desolace
  tip Last stop of the chapter: the route's own guide comes back once these are handed in. Then fly from Nijel's Point to Feathermoon Stronghold: the route's Feralas guide starts there.
  turnin 7041                         -- Talendria

step Nijel's Point: Keeper Marandis
  when complete 7065
  zone Desolace
  tip Keeper Marandis stands in Nijel's Point too.
  turnin 7065                         -- Keeper Marandis
